  "caption": "Cantonese funk rock cut live. Electric guitar scratching sixteenth-note chord chops through a wah, drum kit recorded tight and close with a cracking snare, fat electric bass with a percussive attack carrying the riff, Hammond organ stabs answering the vocal, a short guitar solo. Tight live band sound with close dry drums and a scratchy mid-forward guitar. Male voice, rhythmic and dry, delivered almost as speech on the beat with gang backing shouts. 116 BPM, E minor. Courtesy compressed into forty-five centimetres. No synth pad, no programmed drums, no autotune, no ballad section, no key change.",
  "lyrics": "[Verse]\n一點半 茶餐廳 冇位 伙記叫我「搭枱啦」\n對面個阿叔已經食到一半 佢推一推啲嘢\n冇出聲 冇望我 淨係推一推\n咁就算打過招呼\n\n[Chorus]\n搭枱\n兩個陌生人 四十五厘米\n我哋唔會講嘢 但我哋會幫對方睇住個袋\n香港人嘅禮貌 全部喺呢四十五厘米入面\n\n[Verse]\n佢個電話響 佢聽 佢大聲鬧人\n鬧完佢望我一眼 有啲唔好意思\n我扮睇餐牌 我其實早就睇完\n我哋都知大家做緊咩 大家都冇拆穿\n\n[Chorus]\n搭枱\n兩個陌生人 四十五厘米\n我哋唔會講嘢 但我哋會幫對方睇住個袋\n香港人嘅禮貌 原來全部喺呢四十五厘米入面\n\n[Bridge]\n佢走嗰陣 佢同我講「慢慢食」\n三個字\n我記咗成日\n\n[Outro]\n出面仲有人排緊隊\n我食快咗兩成",
